{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this to .mcp.json (Claude Code) or merge into claude_desktop_config.json.",
    "",
    "THE COMMAND MUST MATCH HOW YOU INSTALLED IT.",
    "",
    "  pip install abaqus-mcp      -> puts `abaqus-mcp` on PATH; use the block below.",
    "  uv tool install abaqus-mcp  -> same; use the block below.",
    "  uvx                         -> installs NOTHING on PATH. The client must run",
    "                                 uvx itself:",
    "                                   \"command\": \"uvx\",",
    "                                   \"args\": [\"--from\", \"abaqus-mcp\", \"abaqus-mcp\"]",
    "  from a clone                -> \"command\": \"python\",",
    "                                 \"args\": [\"-m\", \"abaqus_mcp.server\"],",
    "                                 \"cwd\": \"/path/to/abaqus-mcp\"",
    "",
    "Abaqus itself is auto-discovered from PATH or the SIMULIA Commands dir;",
    "set ABAQUS_AGENT_COMMAND if your launcher lives elsewhere.",
    "ABAQUS_AGENT_RUNS_DIR is optional -- it defaults to ./runs in the launch cwd.",
    "Call check_environment first: it reports what was found and what to set."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "abaqus-mcp": {
      "command": "abaqus-mcp",
      "args": [],
      "env": {
        "ABAQUS_AGENT_RUNS_DIR": "/absolute/path/where/job/output/should/go"
      }
    }
  }
}
